     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%\">Hello Phil:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in 0in 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%\">How can I get the factor means and variances? I tried the\r\nfollowing, but it returns ‘NA’. And the ‘names()’ function in mirt always\r\nreturns NULL. Why?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">theta &lt;- fscores(mod1)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">mean(theta)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">[1] NA</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color